      {
        "question": "What services do you offer?",
        "answer": "Integrated marketing, advertising and PR services: marketing campaigns, programs, events and workshops, billboards and signage, exhibitions and booths, promo videos and photography, social media content, print, promotional gifts and trophies, and web design."
      },
      {
        "question": "Do you work with government entities?",
        "answer": "Yes. Our clients include ministries, municipalities, universities and government bodies in Jeddah, Makkah and Madinah, alongside companies and charities."
      },
      {
        "question": "Can you produce gifts and trophies with our logo?",
        "answer": "Yes. We supply promotional gifts (bags, calendars, pens, keychains, gift sets) as well as plaques, cups and models designed for your organization."
      },
      {
        "question": "Where are you and how can I reach you?",
        "answer": "Our office is in Jeddah – Hail Street – Hawazen Center. Call +966 12 660 5626, message us on WhatsApp at +966 55 128 0719, or email info@sma-adv.com."
